0.12 0.39 0.65 RG 1.3 w 54 498.89 m 130 498.89 l S
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 478.89 Tm (Nexus HMS is a multi-module hotel management platform for hotel operators, front-office teams,) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 464.89 Tm (department supervisors, finance teams, HR teams, tenant administrators, and platform administrators.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.89 Tm (The system supports the hotel lifecycle from property configuration and reservations through guest) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 436.89 Tm (stays, operations, finance, reporting, security, and enterprise administration.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 415.89 Tm (The requirements below describe the behavior delivered across the foundation, hotel core, front) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 401.89 Tm (office, operations, business management, enterprise services, and Phase 7 SaaS and enterprise) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 387.89 Tm (features. The implementation is a modular monolith with a shared PostgreSQL database and a Next.js) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 373.89 Tm (web application.) Tj ET
BT 0.08 0.16 0.27 rg /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 338.89 Tm (2. Actors and permissions) Tj ET
0.12 0.39 0.65 RG 1.3 w 54 332.89 m 130 332.89 l S
