BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 298.89 Tm (  and platform-wide security policy.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 277.89 Tm (- Tenant administrator: manages users and operational configuration inside an assigned tenant,) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 263.89 Tm (  subject to tenant scope.) Tj ET
