BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 775.89 Tm (- HR staff: manage employees, attendance, leave, shifts, and performance reviews.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 754.89 Tm (- Read-only or reporting user: views permitted operational and BI information without mutation) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 740.89 Tm (  rights.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 719.89 Tm (- Mobile client: authenticates a user device, receives scoped synchronization data, and) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 705.89 Tm (  submits offline changes.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 684.89 Tm (Authorization is role-based. The global authentication guard is fail-closed: protected routes require) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.89 Tm (a valid access token. Public routes are explicitly marked and include login, MFA verification, token) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 656.89 Tm (refresh, health, and metrics.) Tj ET
BT 0.08 0.16 0.27 rg /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 621.89 Tm (3. Functional requirements) Tj ET
0.12 0.39 0.65 RG 1.3 w 54 615.89 m 130 615.89 l S
BT 0.12 0.39 0.65 rg /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 587.89 Tm (FR-001 Authentication and session management) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 568.89 Tm (1. The system shall authenticate users with email and password.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 547.89 Tm (2. Passwords shall be verified against bcrypt hashes and inactive users shall be rejected.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.89 Tm (3. Successful authentication shall issue an access token and a refresh token when MFA is not) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 512.89 Tm (enabled.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 491.89 Tm (4. When MFA is enabled, login shall return only a short-lived MFA-pending token and shall) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 477.89 Tm (not grant API access.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 456.89 Tm (5. The MFA verification endpoint shall accept a current TOTP code or a valid one-time backup) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 442.89 Tm (code before issuing full tokens.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 421.89 Tm (6. Refresh endpoints shall be public because an expired access token is expected during) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 407.89 Tm (refresh.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 386.89 Tm (7. Logout shall be available to clients and clients shall remove stored tokens locally.) Tj ET
BT 0.12 0.39 0.65 rg /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 357.89 Tm (FR-002 User and role administration) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 338.89 Tm (1. Authorized administrators shall create, update, deactivate, and view users.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 317.89 Tm (2. Users shall be associated with a role and, where applicable, a tenant.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 296.89 Tm (3. Roles shall be listed and assigned according to the caller's administrative scope.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 275.89 Tm (4. Deactivated users shall not be able to authenticate.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 254.89 Tm (5. User actions and security-sensitive mutations shall be auditable.) Tj ET
BT 0.12 0.39 0.65 rg /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 225.89 Tm (FR-003 Hotel and property configuration) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 206.89 Tm (1. Authorized users shall configure hotels, branches, buildings, floors, room categories,) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 192.89 Tm (room types, amenities, bed types, room images, and room pricing.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 171.89 Tm (2. The room hierarchy shall support availability and operational status management.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 150.89 Tm (3. Pricing rules shall support date ranges and room-type or category-based configuration.) Tj ET
BT 0.12 0.39 0.65 rg /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 121.89 Tm (FR-004 Guest, reservation, and front-office operations) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 102.89 Tm (1. Staff shall create, search, view, update, confirm, cancel, and manage reservations.) Tj ET
