BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 775.89 Tm (5. Scheduled jobs shall support inventory alerts, reservation expiry, statistics reporting,) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 761.89 Tm (and room-status synchronization.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 740.89 Tm (6. Audit logs shall record relevant actions and support review of security events.) Tj ET
BT 0.12 0.39 0.65 rg /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 711.89 Tm (FR-008 SaaS platform administration) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 692.89 Tm (1. Platform administrators shall create and manage tenants and organizations.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 671.89 Tm (2. Subscription records shall represent plan, status, and lifecycle data.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 650.89 Tm (3. Authorized administrators shall configure modules and plugin records.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 629.89 Tm (4. Workflow definitions shall support configurable approvals and transitions where the) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 615.89 Tm (module exposes them.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.89 Tm (5. Tenant context shall be derived from the authenticated caller and used by tenant-aware) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 580.89 Tm (enterprise services.) Tj ET
BT 0.12 0.39 0.65 rg /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 551.89 Tm (FR-009 Real-time events and caching) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 532.89 Tm (1. Authenticated Socket.IO clients shall connect using a JWT during the handshake.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.89 Tm (2. Clients shall subscribe to reservations, rooms, housekeeping, notifications, and) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 497.89 Tm (dashboard channels.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 476.89 Tm (3. Reservation and room mutations shall publish internal EventBus events.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 455.89 Tm (4. The gateway shall broadcast events only to the appropriate tenant-scoped room or) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.89 Tm (subscription.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 420.89 Tm (5. Cache statistics shall expose hit and miss counts.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 399.89 Tm (6. Authorized administrators shall be able to flush cache state; ordinary tenant users shall) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 385.89 Tm (receive a forbidden response.) Tj ET
BT 0.12 0.39 0.65 rg /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 356.89 Tm (FR-010 Security administration) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 337.89 Tm (1. Users shall be able to begin MFA setup and receive a QR code, secret, and backup codes) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 323.89 Tm (for one-time display.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 302.89 Tm (2. TOTP verification shall enable MFA only after a valid current code is supplied.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 281.89 Tm (3. Disabling MFA shall require the current TOTP code.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 260.89 Tm (4. TOTP secrets and backup codes shall be encrypted before database persistence.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 239.89 Tm (5. Platform administrators shall configure password length, complexity, expiry, and password) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 225.89 Tm (reuse settings.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 204.89 Tm (6. Administrators shall add or deactivate IPv4 and IPv4 CIDR allowlist or blocklist rules.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 183.89 Tm (7. Users shall view active mobile devices and revoke their own devices.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 162.89 Tm (8. Malformed persisted IP rules shall be ignored rather than treated as a match.) Tj ET
