BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 114.89 Tm (1. Authenticated users shall register a mobile device with device ID, name, platform, and) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 100.89 Tm (optional push token.) Tj ET
